From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robert McFadden <robert.mcfadden@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:11:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Red Dead Redemption: update 1.0.4 registered

1.0.4 (v262144, main 37531419da7654ec3f5b586693f7f331) changes 45 of shaders.rpf's 3,583 shaders; the
profile's tables are now the union over both builds (3,628), as shader_versions v0 v262144 asks. It runs
on the Mac through two agreements the update adds (each accepted after scrolling to its end) to the
title, at 30 fps with no [RED] line in 8 minutes. The profile registers both builds and packs 1.0.4;
the note records the route, the agreements and what is open (1.0.4 past the title, small dark blocks in
distant foliage in its title scenes).

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#2005
Reason: registers Red Dead Redemption 1.0.4, the version the NSP script packs when the update is present. Goes upstream
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#999

